{"v":4,"catch":"用你的彩虹力量擊敗Boss of Shadow！","desc":"《RAINBOW ISLANDS》是TAITO於1987年發行的一款動作遊戲。\n《BUBBLE BOBBLE》的續集，其中Bubby和Bobby變回人類形態，利用彩虹魔法穿越彩虹群島，將村民從暗影 Boss 的魔掌中解救出來。\n彩虹有多種用途，例如攻擊敵人或作為跳躍平台。\n遊戲包括更新的“RAINBOW ISLANDS EXTRA”，具有改變難度等特徵。\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2024-01-25","genres":["動作","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.2GB / Switch 0.2GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/829b101159ae1b4275b32f411ffb26b54237f45b8b3b6809f29b2f4a7e053f35.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/80824feff64fd9933d6a8b7af86cde85c5d570574c07d9675ae2e07ff21e8ead.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/cd69b865134865f5dc3797c8d30688c2e826b32bccde0572d5bb776dbe51a505.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/4661eeb3269ef66925463970012d65971bc6135fc59db87af8457e7c188ba441.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/3a5d3f8ee87fdee67b8a617edb0c0ee8da604d55ae9c8439c7aa786eae378bd2.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/280936545e0d1fdd78ac902d4fa8aa628167db77dde27e02269b49d8470bc531.jpg"],"titleId":"01004e101d476000","dlc":[]}